    "title": "Concept: What is Biodiversity?",
    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Biodiversity is the <strong>variety of all living organisms</strong> in an area. It includes the number of different species of plants, animals, and microorganisms, as well as the genetic differences within these species and the variety of ecosystems they form.</p>",
