    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Breeding programmes involve the controlled reproduction of endangered species, usually in zoos or wildlife parks. The goal is to increase their population size and genetic diversity for future reintroduction into the wild.</p>",
